            "title": "The Macallan — masters of their craft",
            "blurb": "A distillery team built ten bamboo bikes together — craft meeting craft.",
            "image": "bbc-rd-tb-macallan.jpg",
            "url": "\/blogs\/impact\/the-macallan-whisky-masters-of-their-craft"
          }
        },
        "abstory_4": {
          "type": "story",
          "settings": {
