            "blurb": "Fathers build a bamboo balance bike for the child waiting at home.",
            "image": "bbc-rd-b2b.jpg",
            "url": "\/blogs\/impact\/build-to-bond-the-full-story-of-how-bamboo-bikes-are-rebuilding-family-connections-in-prison-2"
